      "created_at": "2015-03-24T11:06:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only thing I can think of that would've done it would be if Tachyon had her HUD Goggles and/or Pushing the Limits out and had played a Hypersonic Assault before the Blinding Speed (or played the Blinding Speed off a Lightning Reflexes), or if Haka had played Ground Pound...but I'm presuming you'd've noticed if either of those thing had happened ;).</p>",
